{
  "description": "The Pipelex project is structured around a core orchestration engine that manages the execution of AI pipelines. User interaction primarily occurs through a Command-Line Interface (CLI), which initiates pipeline building and execution. Pipeline definitions, written in a declarative PLX format, are processed by a dedicated builder component to create an executable flow. During execution, the orchestration engine dispatches tasks to various pipe operators and controllers, which interact with AI inference and model management services for AI-driven tasks. Data and memory management components handle the flow and storage of information throughout the pipeline. Finally, a reporting and observability component tracks pipeline execution and generates reports.",
